2. **errno classification** — [programs_p5.cljc](/Users/sto/workspace/datomworld-p5r/test/yang/php/antlr/programs_p5.cljc) `:error-handler-and-warnings` diag is now `[[1024 "second"]]` (engine truth); [oracle.clj](/Users/sto/workspace/datomworld-p5r/src/dev/yang/php/oracle.clj) marks recorded pairs class-derived at parse time via metadata (invisible to `pr-str`, so FOLD lines stay verbatim), and new `class-derived?`/`errno-match?`/`diag-match?` count 1024-vs-8 equal only when marked. `check-p5-fixture` compares via `diag-match?`.
